  - finding: "The run is hermetic for the Android emulator's reads only; the same build still runs the host's simctl, security and networksetup"
    waived: "Those host reads are waived at e2e and pinned below it, as UC-ONBOARD's Pinned by lists (real trust stores, system proxies, Simulators); no journey asserts on them. The commit claims only the emulator journey."
refuted: "ONE CANDIDATE REFUTED. altitude, important: the fake adb copies the shell's adb argv with no test tying them - drift in the reads the journey depends on (devices, sys.boot_completed) turns it red loudly, as round 7 observed; drift in the others (name, store, proxy) changes nothing the journey asserts; round 6 waived untied test-side literals of this kind as nits. The correctness finder traced every read the e2e build makes against the fixture and found each answered as the shell parses it."
